{"kind":"html","caption":"从每个与首字母相同的格子出发，使用深度优先搜索依次匹配单词，并只向上、下、左、右移动。进入格子时将其标记为已使用，回溯时撤销标记，因此一条路径不能重复使用同一格。动画展示 \"ABCCED\" 的成功路径，并对比 \"SEE\" 的另一条可行路径与 \"ABCB\" 因无法复用 B 而失败的情况。","html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>单词搜索可视化</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nhtml,body{margin:0;min-height:auto;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\nmain{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px}\nh1{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#d4d4d4}\n.lead{margin:0 0 8px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\n.panel{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#252526}\n.panel-title{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#d4d4d4}\n.rule{padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;background:#2d2d30;border-radius:0 4px 4px 0;line-height:1.45}\n.mono{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.accent{color:#3794ff;font-weight:600}\n.muted{color:#8d8d8d}\n.row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;align-items:center}\n.grid2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px}\n@media(max-width:520px){.grid2{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\n.array,.chars,.row-wrap{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}\n.cell,.char,.num-cell{width:38px;min-height:48px;padding:4px 2px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d30;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font:600 14px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;transition:.3s}\n.cell .idx,.char .index,.index,.marker{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;margin-top:2px;font-weight:400}\n.cell.active,.cell.mid,.cell.current,.cell.found,.cell.max,.char.active,.num-cell.active{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.cell.out,.cell.discarded{opacity:.35}\n.card{padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#2d2d30}\n.card-label{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;margin-bottom:4px}\n.card-value{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;color:#3794ff}\n.progress{display:flex;gap:4px;margin-top:8px}\n.dot,.pill{flex:1;height:3px;border-radius:2px;background:#3c3c3c;transition:background .3s}\n.dot.on,.pill.on{background:#3794ff}\n.pills{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px}\n.pills .pill{flex:none;height:auto;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;color:#8d8d8d}\n.pills .pill.active,.pills .pill.on{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.status{margin-top:6px;padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;background:#2d2d30;border-radius:0 4px 4px 0;line-height:1.45;min-height:auto}\n\n.layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px}\n@media(max-width:520px){.layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\n.board{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,38px);gap:4px;justify-content:start}\n.board .cell{width:38px;min-height:48px}\n.letter{font-size:14px;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:700}\n.coord{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d}\n.cell.current{box-shadow:0 0 0 1px #3794ff}\n.cell.blocked{background:#4a2c2c;border-color:#d16969}\n.word-row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px;margin-bottom:6px}\n.token{min-width:28px;padding:4px 6px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;font-size:12px;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.token.done,.token.now{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.rules{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:1.45;margin-top:8px}\n.rules .rule{padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#252526}\n.rules b{color:#3794ff;display:block;margin-bottom:2px;font-size:11px}\n.examples{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:1.45}\n.yes{color:#89d185}.no{color:#f48771}\n.legend{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:4px}\n.legend .dot{width:10px;height:10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:3px}\n.legend .dot.used{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff}\n.legend .dot.bad{background:#4a2c2c;border-color:#d16969}\n\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<h1>网格 DFS 逐字匹配</h1>\n<p class=\"lead\">四向相邻，路径格子不可复用。</p>\n<section class=\"layout\">\n<div class=\"panel\"><div class=\"panel-title\">board</div><div id=\"board\" class=\"board\"></div>\n<div class=\"legend\"><span><span class=\"dot used\"></span>路径</span><span><span class=\"dot bad\"></span>阻止</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"panel\"><div class=\"panel-title\">匹配 <span id=\"wordName\" class=\"mono\"></span></div><div id=\"wordRow\" class=\"word-row\"></div><div id=\"status\" class=\"status\"></div></div>\n</section>\n<div class=\"rules\"><div class=\"rule\"><b>起点</b>字符等于首字母才启动 DFS</div><div class=\"rule\"><b>扩展</b>四邻匹配下一字符</div><div class=\"rule\"><b>回溯</b>失败撤销占用标记</div></div>\n<section class=\"panel\"><div class=\"panel-title\">样例结论</div><div class=\"examples\">\n<div><span class=\"mono\">ABCCED</span> <span class=\"yes\">true</span></div>\n<div><span class=\"mono\">SEE</span> <span class=\"yes\">true</span></div>\n<div><span class=\"mono\">ABCB</span> <span class=\"no\">false</span>（不能复用 B）</div>\n</div></section>\n</main>\n<script>\n\n(() => {\n  const data = [\n    ['A','B','C','E'],\n    ['S','F','C','S'],\n    ['A','D','E','E']\n  ];\n  const scenarios = [\n    {\n      word: 'ABCCED',\n      path: [[0,0],[0,1],[0,2],[1,2],[2,2],[2,1]],\n      messages: [\n        '找到起点 <strong>A</strong>，标记 (0,0) 为已使用。',\n        '向右移动，<strong>B</strong> 与单词第 2 个字符相同。',\n        '继续向右，匹配第一个 <strong>C</strong>。',\n        '向下进入相邻格，匹配第二个 <strong>C</strong>。',\n        '向下匹配 <strong>E</strong>，路径中的格子仍保持已使用。',\n        '向左匹配 <strong>D</strong>，全部字符匹配完成，返回 true。'\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      word: 'SEE',\n      path: [[1,3],[2,3],[2,2]],\n      messages: [\n        '切换到样例 2：从右侧的 <strong>S</strong> 启动搜索。',\n        '向下移动到 <strong>E</strong>，符合水平或垂直相邻规则。',\n        '再向左匹配 <strong>E</strong>，单词全部匹配，返回 true。'\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      word: 'ABCB',\n      path: [[0,0],[0,1],[0,2]],\n      blocked: [0,1],\n      messages: [\n        '切换到样例 3：从左上角 <strong>A</strong> 开始。',\n        '向右匹配 <strong>B</strong>，并将该格标记为已使用。',\n        '继续向右匹配 <strong>C</strong>。',\n        '下一个字符需要 <strong>B</strong>，但相邻位置没有可用的 B；原来的 B 已使用，不能回头复用。搜索其他起点也失败，因此返回 false。'\n      ]\n    }\n  ];\n\n  const boardEl = document.getElementById('board');\n  const wordEl = document.getElementById('wordRow');\n  const wordName = document.getElementById('wordName');\n  const statusEl = document.getElementById('status');\n\n  data.forEach((row, r) => row.forEach((char, c) => {\n    const cell = document.createElement('div');\n    cell.className = 'cell';\n    cell.dataset.key = `${r},${c}`;\n    cell.innerHTML = `<span class=\"letter\">${char}</span><span class=\"coord\">行 ${r} · 列 ${c}</span>`;\n    boardEl.appendChild(cell);\n  }));\n\n  let scenarioIndex = 0;\n  let step = 0;\n\n  function render() {\n    const s = scenarios[scenarioIndex];\n    const visiblePathLength = Math.min(step + 1, s.path.length);\n    wordName.textContent = s.word;\n    wordEl.innerHTML = '';\n\n    [...s.word].forEach((char, i) => {\n      const token = document.createElement('span');\n      token.className = 'token';\n      if (i < visiblePathLength - 1) token.classList.add('done');\n      if (i === visiblePathLength - 1 && step < s.path.length) token.classList.add('now');\n      token.textContent = char;\n      wordEl.appendChild(token);\n    });\n\n    document.querySelectorAll('.cell').forEach(cell => cell.className = 'cell');\n    s.path.slice(0, visiblePathLength).forEach((pos, i) => {\n      const cell = document.querySelector(`[data-key=\"${pos[0]},${pos[1]}\"]`);\n      if (cell) cell.classList.add(i === visiblePathLength - 1 ? 'current' : 'active');\n    });\n\n    if (s.blocked && step >= s.path.length) {\n      const blocked = document.querySelector(`[data-key=\"${s.blocked[0]},${s.blocked[1]}\"]`);\n      if (blocked) {\n        blocked.className = 'cell blocked';\n        blocked.querySelector('.coord').textContent = '已在当前路径中';\n      }\n    }\n\n    document.querySelectorAll('.cell').forEach(cell => {\n      if (!cell.classList.contains('blocked')) {\n        const [r,c] = cell.dataset.key.split(',');\n        cell.querySelector('.coord').textContent = `行 ${r} · 列 ${c}`;\n      }\n    });\n\n    const msgIndex = Math.min(step, s.messages.length - 1);\n    statusEl.innerHTML = `<strong>步骤 ${msgIndex + 1}</strong><br>${s.messages[msgIndex]}`;\n  }\n\n  function advance() {\n    const s = scenarios[scenarioIndex];\n    const maxStep = s.messages.length - 1;\n    if (step < maxStep) {\n      step++;\n    } else {\n      scenarioIndex = (scenarioIndex + 1) % scenarios.length;\n      step = 0;\n    }\n    render();\n  }\n\n  render();\n  setInterval(advance, 1900);\n})();\n\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","svg":"","media":""}
